<!--Gem_Page_Main_Editor--><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="gryffeditor"><div data-label="Row" id="r-1570091528293" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1570091528293"><div class="gf_col-md-12 gf_column" id="c-1543568516287" data-id="1543568516287"><div data-label="Heading" id="e-1570091528296" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1570091528296"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">Level 3 Personal Training</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1612991954751" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1612991954751"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>The home study fitness education videos on this page will help you to achieve your Level 3 Personal Trainer certification and gain the credentials for successful fitness career in the fitness industry. (Please note if you are studying Level 2 Fitness Instructor then there is a separate playlist for this that your tutor can send to you if applicable to your study)</p><p><br></p><p>For more fitness-related videos please subscribe to the Study Active YouTube channel <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@studyactive" class="" target="_blank"><u>here&nbsp;</u></a></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" id="r-1612122066084" class="gf_row gf_row-fluid gf_row-no-padding gf_row-gap-0" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1612122066084" data-extraclass="" data-row-gap="0px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-4 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1602648366301" data-id="1602648366301" style=""><div data-label="Liquid" id="m-1612122066054" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-liquid" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1612122066054" data-name="Right click on the module, then choose Edit Html / Liquid option to start writing your c